<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Your Name | Personal Website</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Your Name</h1>
      <p class="small">Aspiring Full Stack Developer | Student | Problem Solver</p>
      <div class="contact">
        <a href="mailto:youremail@example.com">Email</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/yourusername" target="_blank">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/yourusername" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <p>
        Write a short introduction here. Talk about who you are, what you are studying,
        what kind of developer you want to become, and what skills you are building.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</li>
        <li>Git and GitHub</li>
        <li>Responsive Web Design</li>
        <li>Node.js / React / SQL (edit based on your skills)</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Projects</h2>
      <div class="project">
        <h3>Project Name 1</h3>
        <p>
          Briefly describe the project, what it does, and what tools or technologies you used.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="project">
        <h3>Project Name 2</h3>
        <p>
          Add another project here with a short explanation of its purpose and your role.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Experience</h2>
      <div class="job">
        <h3>Job Title or Relevant Role</h3>
        <p class="small">Company Name | Start Date - End Date</p>
        <p>
          Describe responsibilities, transferable skills, teamwork, communication, or technical work.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <p>
        School or Program Name<br />
        Degree / Certificate / Training Program<br />
        Expected Graduation or Completion Date
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Goals</h2>
      <p>
        Share what you are working toward, such as becoming a full stack developer,
        improving your portfolio, or gaining real-world software development experience.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
